  "text_md": "![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile38.png>)\nLleonada de garriga Coenonympha dorus\nSaltabardisses cintada Pyronia bathseba\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile41.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile10.png>)\nDamer dels conillets Melitaea deione\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile7.png>)\nCapgròs comú Carcharodus alceae\nPapallona reina Papilio machaon\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile16.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile9.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile43.png>)\nEscac ferruginós Melanargia occitanica\nTERRA BAIXA MEDITERRÀNIA\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile13.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile18.png>)\nBlanqueta de la col Pieris rapae\nBlaveta del crespinell Scolitantides orion\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile26.png>)\nBlaveta de la farigola Pseudophilotes panoptes\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile23.png>)\nSafranera de l’alfals Colias crocea\nEscac ibèric Melanargia lachesis\nMargenera comuna Lasiommata megera\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile24.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile28.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile12.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile48.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile5.png>)\nAtalanta Vanessa atalanta\nDaurat fosc Thymelicus acteon\nPapallona del lledoner Libythea celtis\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile46.png>)\nTurquesa mediterrània Glaucopsyche melanops\nBrocat variable Euphydryas aurinia\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile45.png>)\nBlaveta de l’heura Celastrina argiolus\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile47.png>)\nPòntia comuna Pontia daplidice\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile39.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile8.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile44.png>)\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile29.png>)\nBruna de bosc Pararge aegeria\nMerlet ruderal Pyrgus armoricanus\nVerdeta d’ull ros Callophrys avis\n![](<f7469518fa45151f23fc0189cd9d284e52f694ce_page_1_images/imageFile19.png>)",
